                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.3531/1560: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Argentina</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Tuck</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Acting Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Buenos
                                Aires</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1940-08-07T19:00:00-03:00">August 7, 1940—7
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received August 7—6:17 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>333. Embassy’s 305, July 19, 3 p.m. The Minister for Foreign Affairs has just
                    requested me by telephone to inform you that his Government would welcome the
                    visit to Argentina of the mission referred to in the Department’s 139, July 6, 6
                        [<hi rendition="#italic">4</hi>] p.m.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Tuck</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
